# behavior 1
# name: buffer_partition_then_heal
# provenance: the partition contract in NetworkSim.h (V05): a disconnect blocks
#   both directions and queues what it blocked.
# status: desired
# scope: partition, multiple producers
# expect converged yes
# note: replica 1 disconnects, both sides edit, then replica 1 reconnects and
#   delivers. Before the heal the replicas must differ; the deliveries after the
#   heal are what make the final state identical.
#collabtext-trace 1
#model buffer
#label partition-then-heal
#seed 42
#replicas 2
#net 50 200 500 1
edit 0 0 0 61
deliver 1 0
disconnect 1
edit 0 1 1 62
edit 1 0 0 63
reconnect 1
deliver 1 1
deliver 0 2
